// Category: the `[convergent]` equation flag across later declarations.
//
// HS `addMacroSym` rebuilds the signature through the monoid `<>`
// (Term/Maude/Signature.hs), so a `macros:` block AFTER
// `equations [convergent]:` drops the flag: the echo prints `equations:`.
// sig_convergent_then_functions is the `functions:` twin.  No corpus theory
// declares macros after convergent equations.

theory SigConvergentThenMacros
begin

functions: f/1, a/0

equations [convergent]: f(x) = a

macros: m(x) = f(x)

end
